 3 files changed, 13 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 docs/design/stitch-redesign-2026-11/qa/impl/journey-trips-before-after.png

diff --git a/components/marketplace/approved-inner-2026-11.css b/components/marketplace/approved-inner-2026-11.css
index a3ecd4e..406c214 100644
--- a/components/marketplace/approved-inner-2026-11.css
+++ b/components/marketplace/approved-inner-2026-11.css
@@ -50,3 +50,12 @@
 
 @media(max-width:800px){.approved-site.ks-inner>main .page-hero{padding:36px 18px 24px}}
 @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.approved-site.ks-inner *{transition:none!important}}
+
+/* ---- JourneyShell pages (47 routes) — light consistency layer, owner-approved 1405-08-26 ----
+   Excludes the approved header/footer, the search card and the support dock. Palette already matches. */
+.journey-page .button:not(:where(.approved-shared-header,.kh-foot,.approved-search-card,.support-dock) *){border-radius:999px}
+.journey-page .button.primary:not(:where(.approved-shared-header,.kh-foot,.approved-search-card,.support-dock) *){background:var(--j-coral,#ef5b3d);color:#fff;border-color:transparent}
+.journey-page .button.primary:not(:where(.approved-shared-header,.kh-foot,.approved-search-card,.support-dock) *):hover{background:#e0492b}
+.journey-page .button.secondary:not(:where(.approved-shared-header,.kh-foot,.approved-search-card,.support-dock) *){background:var(--j-paper,#fffaf4);border-color:#e7dcd4;color:var(--j-plum,#2a1530)}
+.journey-page :focus-visible{outline:3px solid #0b8f8b;outline-offset:2px}
+.journey-page .journey-mock{background:#fbe9c6;color:#6a4708;border-radius:999px}
diff --git a/docs/adr/ADR-023-inner-pages-refinement-on-production-2026-11.md b/docs/adr/ADR-023-inner-pages-refinement-on-production-2026-11.md
index fbd91fc..ba3cf88 100644
--- a/docs/adr/ADR-023-inner-pages-refinement-on-production-2026-11.md
+++ b/docs/adr/ADR-023-inner-pages-refinement-on-production-2026-11.md
@@ -16,3 +16,7 @@
 
 ## Rollback
 - `git revert` این commit یا بازگرداندن image پشتیبان `karenseir-web:pre-redesign-*` روی سرور (`deploy/redesign-2026-11-rollback.sh`).
+
+## افزوده ۱۴۰۵/۰۸/۲۶ — صفحات JourneyShell (۴۷ صفحه، تأیید مالک)
+- لایه سبک یکدستی: دکمه‌های pill، primary کورال، secondary کرم، focus ring، برچسب Mock طلایی؛ هدر/فوتر/کارت جست‌وجو/SupportDock مستثنا.
+- شواهد پیکسلی قبل/بعد: صفحه اول، /hotels، /flights، /account، /manage-booking، /restaurants بدون تفاوت؛ /trips، /tours، /support فقط دکمه‌ها (۱۱۹–۱۶۷ پیکسل). تصویر: `qa/impl/journey-trips-before-after.png`.
